  "inscription": "DEDICATED TO THE CANADIAN CREW/ OF THE RAF WELLINGTON Mk X LN181 OF 82 OTU/ Which crashed in Yardley Gobion on the night of 20th March 1944,/ killing all eight crew members./ Fg Off Charles Richard Floyd/ Fg Off Ronald Frank Calnan/ Fg Off Ralph Northcliffe MacGillivray/ Fg Off Daniel Louis Jacobs/ Fg Off Melville Lloyd Fullerton/ Sgt Lorne Herbert Johnston/ Sgt Harry Charles Millen/ Sgt William James Mohring/ RCAF insignia: PER ARDUA AD ASTRA/ ROYAL CANADIAN AIR FORCE/ RAF insignia: PER ARDUA AD ASTRA",
